<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1965</h1><p class="ref-lede">1965 in world history: 36 events, 3 births, 23 deaths, 5 works, 3 states founded and 3 that came to an end. 304 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
